On macOS, libxml2 and zlib come from the operating system and are not bundled.
The Windows installer, when a release includes OpenConnect for the system-wide
path, carries openconnect.exe with Windows builds of the same libraries and
also libxml2 (https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2, MIT License, Copyright
