You may replace any of these libraries or the openconnect program in your copy
of Hostbay with your own build of the same interface. Their source is available
from the upstream addresses above. In addition, for three years after each
Hostbay release that ships them, the Hostbay contributors will give anyone who
asks the complete corresponding source code of OpenConnect and of each library
above under the LGPL or GPL, in the exact versions that release ships, for no
more than the cost of physically delivering it. Ask through
https://github.com/lsanthosh08/hostbay/issues, naming the release.

